- (a) Each yard sale shall be limited to one three (3) day period;

- (b) Yard sales shall not occur on any property more often than four (4) times per calendar year;

- (c) It shall be a violation of this ordinance to sell, offer for sale, or display for sale merchandise in any yard, carport, garage or house that is not the personal property of the occupants of the property.

- (d) This Ordinance shall not regulate the private sale of major personal property possessions, such as homes, boats and personal automobiles.
